  {"content":"User:\nWhat do you remember?\n\nRouting is complete for this turn: chat. Now answer the user directly in character. Do not call route again or describe your reasoning or routing decision.\n\n[Host conversation context: the current responder is Scout. Give only Scout's next reply in this existing group chat. Do not write another participant's lines or repeat speaker labels.]\n\n[Current request: respond to the human input in this turn as Scout. If it greets you, greet the speaker; do not answer an earlier question or resume an older task. Other personas' requests and answers are context, not assignments for you. Refer to earlier findings when this input asks about them. Give only your own reply, without another speaker's lines.]","role":"user"}
